{"id": "sllama0100", "pool": "sllama", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3094751261, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "41a5db294317f43671e96d4157e9209f1111c47f4a217fdcbe5e389282f03cfe", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 0, "query": "What is  the highest-attended tennis tournament?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/sllama0100.wav", "input_sha256": "9e9ba4b78a0b117a258ffaf872cefc0de40de8abebbbf07aa14cbedf28c922a1", "input_samples": 46553, "input_s": 2.91, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.671, "act": 0.9998, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "The Australian Open is currently the highest-attended tennis tournament. The 2026 Australian Open reported 1,368,043 total attendees over three weeks, with 1,150,444 for the main draw. (ausopen.com) If you mean highest attendance for a single tennis match, that record is different: 51,954 attended Federer vs. Nadal’s Match in Africa in Cape Town in 2020.", "expert_answer": "The **Australian Open** is currently the highest-attended tennis tournament.\n\nThe **2026 Australian Open** reported **1,368,043 total attendees** over three weeks, with **1,150,444** for the main draw. ([ausopen.com](https://ausopen.com/articles/news/australian-open-2026-numbers?utm_source=openai))\n\nIf you mean **highest attendance for a single tennis match**, that record is different: **51,954** attended Federer vs. Nadal’s *Match in Africa* in Cape Town in 2020.", "transcript": "What is the highest attended tennis tournament?\n", "asr_s": 0.59, "expert_s": 6.73, "expert_input_samples": 46553, "expert_input_s": 2.91, "expert_input_sha256": "9e9ba4b78a0b117a258ffaf872cefc0de40de8abebbbf07aa14cbedf28c922a1", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 6.119, "relay_synth_ms": 12461, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_ch